See #6255 for an example branch where this happens. One thing I noticed while investigating this is that the verify-script creates a fresh GOPATH in a temp dir, installs godep there, and builds codecgen there, then uses _that_ codecgen to verify the generated files. I updated codecgen on my system gopath to ensure I wasn't having some kind of mismatch (even though update- runs codecgen using godep).

@lavalamp @wojtek-t 
